{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は生ドルでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月のゲストは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめキュンフルーツ缶さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"谷尾桜子さん、菊原結里亜さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの皆様、\nツインテールのコーナー前の写メで\n本当にすみません..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新曲の『伊予魂乙女節』\n一緒にコラボできて楽しかった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真似しやすい振付でライブ行ったら\nすごい盛り上がりそう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田も餃子好きだから\nいつか一緒に餃子を食べに行きたいなって思いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さくらシンデレラさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"成瀬あんずさん、 美和花樺さん\n夏生のんさん、桜瀬もえさん、蓮水あいさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロコドルさんって上京するかしないか\nハッキリ別れるイメージだけど\n名古屋でも東京でも応援できるアイドル\nって素晴らしい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなでイヤホンガンガンゲームできて\nなんか仲良くなれた気がします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん個性があって\nフレッシュでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださってありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月が誕生月の生ドルコンビ\nお誕生日のお祝いしてもらっちゃいました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"23時とかだったけど\nその場でちゃんと食べちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に美味しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"観てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！\nコメントもありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"タイムシフトやPgooで\n観てくださるかたは\nお楽しみに！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/25/5938385/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}